        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f90ce0f99c314ff8a2d2e9eb0c85fc60",
      "statement": "Neither GitHubService nor its two write methods are covered by the test suite — the only test touching GitHubConfig asserts that the generated validator rejects a blank API key — so the not_planned close reason, the comment-then-close ordering, and the absence of retry rest on review alone and need manual verification against a real installation when changed.",
